"Turn Off" = "关闭";
"Reset rollover?" = "重置结转？";
"Changing how often this budget repeats clears the %@ from earlier periods. Rollover starts again from this period." = "更改此预算的重复频率将清除已结转的%@。结转将从本周期重新开始。";
